        "story_eyebrow": "Made By Hand",
        "story_heading": "Every piece, considered",
        "story_text": "<p>From the very start, the aim was to create an accessory that could reflect light with the same magic and intensity — something that could be carried and worn all year long.</p><p>Today, we're continually exploring unexpected combinations: luminous crystals paired with rich wood, brass, and leather that bring depth and character to every design.</p>",
        "duo_video_a": "shopify://files/videos/SnapInsta.to_AQP8Op8-T9hfXn-2nn1KfIc8XUI8SgW5dcLz-YsUCL9kYihuz0IesHB8LEg4im0ueEo0rnkWgV--tmyLxLDeR-0f.mp4",
        "duo_eyebrow": "",
        "duo_copy": "Thank you for being part of this journey. Your appreciation for artistry and thoughtful design allows us to continue pushing the boundaries of what a crystal handbag can be.",
        "closing_text": "Today, every handbag we make is rooted in that first moment of inspiration.",
        "closing_link_label": "Shop the Collection",
